    void append(String w) { /* link at tail, index.computeIfAbsent(w, ...).add(n) */ }
    int find(String w) { /* first node via index, count from head */ }
    void delete(Node n) { /* unlink, remove from index */ }
}
```

**Edge cases:** empty document, deleting the head or tail, duplicate words, editing to an existing word, word not found (return -1 or throw).
